1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,981
Mana shu zarba hal qiladi.

2
00:00:02,001 --> 00:00:02,961
To‘xtating.

3
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:04,836
Hisob uch — ikki.

4
00:00:04,856 --> 00:00:07,736
Sizningcha, urdimi yoki to‘xtatdimi?

5
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:10,135
Ikkala tarkibni ham siz tanlagansiz.

6
00:00:10,155 --> 00:00:11,355
O‘n ikki zarba.

7
00:00:11,450 --> 00:00:13,680
Prime Fc oldinga chiqdi.

8
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:17,182
Keyin Wakanda uchta zarbani ketma-ket urdi.

9
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:20,501
Va o‘sha oxirgi zarba… to‘xtatildi!

10
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,921
Wakanda Team — finalda.

11
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:25,470
Bu klubni oddiy muxlis ochgan edi.

12
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:27,090
Endi u finalda.

13
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:31,688
Endi ikkinchi yarim final: Qayrat Fc — Prime Avangard.

14
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:35,754
Izohga qaysi klubni yozsangiz — o‘sha klub birinchi zarbani uradi.

15
00:00:35,774 --> 00:00:37,274
Yigirma to‘rt soat.

16
00:00:37,294 --> 00:00:38,454
Obuna shart.

